  "title": "Why You See the Game When You Close Your Eyes #shorts",
  "description": "Kabir plays a block game all weekend and sees falling blocks every time he closes his eyes. Stickgold et al. (Science, 2000): after hours of Tetris over three days, 17 of 27 players reported Tetris images as they fell asleep, including 3 of 5 amnesic patients who couldn't remember playing. The Tetris effect: what you repeat, your brain replays. #psychology #shorts #gaming #sleep",
